{"id":"9f20a389e87b9d76","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-lc-measurable-cardinal-ultrafilter.md","title":"ZFC LC Measurable Cardinal Ultrafilter","display":"df-zfc-lc-measurable-cardinal-ultrafilter — ZFC LC Measurable Cardinal Ultrafilter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-lc-measurable-cardinal-ultrafilter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-lc-measurable-cardinal-ultrafilter"],"display":"df-zfc-lc-measurable-cardinal-ultrafilter — ZFC LC Measurable Cardinal Ultrafilter","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-lc-measurable-cardinal-ultrafilter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-lc-measurable-cardinal-ultrafilter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-lc-measurable-cardinal-ultrafilter — ZFC LC Measurable Cardinal Ultrafilter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,U\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,U\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\)</span> (ultrafilter candidate on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcMeasurableCardinalUltrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcMeasurableCardinalUltrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcMeasurableCardinalUltrafilter}_S(\\kappa,U)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\neg\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl(U=\\{X\\subseteq\\kappa\\mid\\alpha\\in X\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\;\\forall F\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\lambda,U)\n\\to\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\mid\\forall\\xi\\in\\lambda\\;(\\alpha\\in F(\\xi))\\}\\in U\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcMeasurableCardinalUltrafilter}_S(\\kappa,U)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\neg\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl(U=\\{X\\subseteq\\kappa\\mid\\alpha\\in X\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\;\\forall F\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\lambda,U)\n\\to\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\mid\\forall\\xi\\in\\lambda\\;(\\alpha\\in F(\\xi))\\}\\in U\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The intersection is formed relative to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>; at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=0\">\\(\\lambda=0\\)</span> it is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in U\">\\(\\kappa\\in U\\)</span>, so no undefined empty intersection is used.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","em